<title>UK: UBS adds 25.4 mln stg to asset-backed FRN.</title>
<headline>UBS adds 25.4 mln stg to asset-backed FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche asset-backed bond has been increased to 199.1 million stg from 171.9 million stg, sole lead manager UBS Ltd said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUTOFUNDING NO 2 PLC</p>
<p> TRANCE A</p>
<p> AMT    185.9 MLN STG BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **16.JUN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE   *26.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST. **EXPECTED MATURITY FIVE YRS</p>
<p>		THERE ARE CLASS B NOTES NOW TOTALLING 13.2 MLN STG</p>
<p>		PAYING 3M LIBOR +37.5 BP, ISSUE PRICE PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
